{"id":"c08c04863d93c6e9","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-dedekind-domain.md","title":"Dedekind Domain","display":"df-dedekind-domain — Dedekind Domain","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-dedekind-domain","aliases":["58-df-dedekind-domain"],"display":"df-dedekind-domain — Dedekind Domain","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-alg-integral-domain.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-dedekind-domain"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-dedekind-domain</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dedekind-domain — Dedekind Domain"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"19475a0b6c0562a5\" href=\"?note=19475a0b6c0562a5\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-alg-integral-domain.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-alg-integral-domain.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,+,\\cdot,0,1,I,P\\in V\">\\(R,+,\\cdot,0,1,I,P\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgIntegralDomain}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgIntegralDomain}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (交换整环谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"19475a0b6c0562a5\" href=\"?note=19475a0b6c0562a5\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-alg-integral-domain.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-alg-integral-domain.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RingIdeal}_S,\\mathrm{PrimeRingIdeal}_S,\\mathrm{MaximalRingIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{RingIdeal}_S,\\mathrm{PrimeRingIdeal}_S,\\mathrm{MaximalRingIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (本文件定义的环理想谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NoetherianRing}_S,\\mathrm{IntegrallyClosedDomain}_S,\\mathrm{DedekindDomain}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{NoetherianRing}_S,\\mathrm{IntegrallyClosedDomain}_S,\\mathrm{DedekindDomain}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (本文件定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}ring\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{RingIdeal}_S(I,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\leftrightarrow I\\subseteq R\\land0\\in I\\land\\forall a,b\\in I\\;(a-b\\in I)\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall a\\in I\\;(r\\cdot a\\in I)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}ring\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{RingIdeal}_S(I,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\leftrightarrow I\\subseteq R\\land0\\in I\\land\\forall a,b\\in I\\;(a-b\\in I)\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall a\\in I\\;(r\\cdot a\\in I)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}prime\\text{-}ring\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{PrimeRingIdeal}_S(P,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RingIdeal}_S(P,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\land P\\neq R\\land\\forall a,b\\in R\\;(a\\cdot b\\in P\\to a\\in P\\lor b\\in P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}prime\\text{-}ring\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{PrimeRingIdeal}_S(P,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RingIdeal}_S(P,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\land P\\neq R\\land\\forall a,b\\in R\\;(a\\cdot b\\in P\\to a\\in P\\lor b\\in P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}ring\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{MaximalRingIdeal}_S(P,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RingIdeal}_S(P,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\land P\\neq R\\land\\forall I\\subseteq R\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{RingIdeal}_S(I,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\land P\\subseteq I\\to I=P\\lor I=R\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}ring\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{MaximalRingIdeal}_S(P,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RingIdeal}_S(P,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\land P\\neq R\\land\\forall I\\subseteq R\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{RingIdeal}_S(I,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\land P\\subseteq I\\to I=P\\lor I=R\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}noetherian} \\vdash \\mathrm{NoetherianRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(R)\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal C\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall I\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\mathrm{RingIdeal}_S(I,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\to\\exists M\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\forall I\\in\\mathcal C\\;(M\\subseteq I\\to I=M)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}noetherian} \\vdash \\mathrm{NoetherianRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(R)\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal C\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall I\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\mathrm{RingIdeal}_S(I,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\to\\exists M\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\forall I\\in\\mathcal C\\;(M\\subseteq I\\to I=M)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}integrally\\text{-}closed} \\vdash \\mathrm{IntegrallyClosedDomain}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcAlgIntegralDomain}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\land\\forall a,b\\in R\\;\\left[b\\neq0\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists c\\in R^n\\;\\left(a^n+\\sum_{i\\in n}c(i)a^ib^{n-i}=0\\right)\\to\\exists r\\in R\\;(a=r\\cdot b)\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}integrally\\text{-}closed} \\vdash \\mathrm{IntegrallyClosedDomain}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcAlgIntegralDomain}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\land\\forall a,b\\in R\\;\\left[b\\neq0\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists c\\in R^n\\;\\left(a^n+\\sum_{i\\in n}c(i)a^ib^{n-i}=0\\right)\\to\\exists r\\in R\\;(a=r\\cdot b)\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}domain} \\vdash \\mathrm{DedekindDomain}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcAlgIntegralDomain}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\land\\mathrm{NoetherianRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\land\\mathrm{IntegrallyClosedDomain}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\land\\forall P\\subseteq R\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PrimeRingIdeal}_S(P,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\land P\\neq\\{0\\}\\to\\mathrm{MaximalRingIdeal}_S(P,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}domain} \\vdash \\mathrm{DedekindDomain}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcAlgIntegralDomain}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\land\\mathrm{NoetherianRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\land\\mathrm{IntegrallyClosedDomain}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\land\\forall P\\subseteq R\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PrimeRingIdeal}_S(P,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\land P\\neq\\{0\\}\\to\\mathrm{MaximalRingIdeal}_S(P,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Dedekind domains are Noetherian, integrally closed integral domains in which every nonzero prime ring ideal is maximal.</li>\n<li>这里的 prime/maximal ideal 明确是交换环理想，不再误用幂集格上的集合理想或“关系的定义域”。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-alg-integral-domain.md","status":"resolved","id":"19475a0b6c0562a5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-alg-integral-domain.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-alg-integral-domain.md","status":"resolved","id":"19475a0b6c0562a5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcAlgIntegralDomain}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (交换整环谓词, see [[../batch05/58-df-zfc-alg-integral-domain.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,+,\\cdot,0,1,I,P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgIntegralDomain}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RingIdeal}_S,\\mathrm{PrimeRingIdeal}_S,\\mathrm{MaximalRingIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NoetherianRing}_S,\\mathrm{IntegrallyClosedDomain}_S,\\mathrm{DedekindDomain}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}ring\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{RingIdeal}_S(I,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\leftrightarrow I\\subseteq R\\land0\\in I\\land\\forall a,b\\in I\\;(a-b\\in I)\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall a\\in I\\;(r\\cdot a\\in I)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}prime\\text{-}ring\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{PrimeRingIdeal}_S(P,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RingIdeal}_S(P,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\land P\\neq R\\land\\forall a,b\\in R\\;(a\\cdot b\\in P\\to a\\in P\\lor b\\in P)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}ring\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{MaximalRingIdeal}_S(P,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RingIdeal}_S(P,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\land P\\neq R\\land\\forall I\\subseteq R\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{RingIdeal}_S(I,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\land P\\subseteq I\\to I=P\\lor I=R\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}noetherian} \\vdash \\mathrm{NoetherianRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(R)\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal C\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall I\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\mathrm{RingIdeal}_S(I,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\to\\exists M\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\forall I\\in\\mathcal C\\;(M\\subseteq I\\to I=M)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}integrally\\text{-}closed} \\vdash \\mathrm{IntegrallyClosedDomain}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcAlgIntegralDomain}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\land\\forall a,b\\in R\\;\\left[b\\neq0\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists c\\in R^n\\;\\left(a^n+\\sum_{i\\in n}c(i)a^ib^{n-i}=0\\right)\\to\\exists r\\in R\\;(a=r\\cdot b)\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dedekind\\text{-}domain} \\vdash \\mathrm{DedekindDomain}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcAlgIntegralDomain}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\land\\mathrm{NoetherianRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\land\\mathrm{IntegrallyClosedDomain}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\land\\forall P\\subseteq R\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PrimeRingIdeal}_S(P,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\land P\\neq\\{0\\}\\to\\mathrm{MaximalRingIdeal}_S(P,R,+,\\cdot,0,1)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":2872,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-398","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-dedekind-domain.md|58-df-dedekind-domain]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["19475a0b6c0562a5","1c30d21ea7b443f6"]}